75\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgRrLGQ7DL_5qmMtxIJTzBa-NAjxI9Zlv6bQqX-OcnBWcm_1lvI0o_NKk_gtdzASLbSE0UqNjXE08rckWrPZjk8gO66nS0jPWsOh-6WjOzAkSjCRO8AUri1sDNPGY7ouopugUF0dFzrBCxgIYoc0ITJQQUAnoAnI--v5BXDJrIIXeQI224m4-wS3AtGVSuc=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj-yQMLoZERaIE08rr-B8IsCwx-Nm5YJxjCc6wq0og4DVahYBALoUJ0Mvfe3x718Y7DLHaah9ME6FKeX7_qWmbFNohgKt_Jhmg8FFG2O-PgqjcllFOVJsKISNaVRGXczwSPp6aJP7EvvQPo_TGdl1GyXqANQB6JCLrnc935L2WRmiFW3FxTrn1QCRcI1KXg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj-yQMLoZERaIE08rr-B8IsCwx-Nm5YJxjCc6wq0og4DVahYBALoUJ0Mvfe3x718Y7DLHaah9ME6FKeX7_qWmbFNohgKt_Jhmg8FFG2O-PgqjcllFOVJsKISNaVRGXczwSPp6aJP7EvvQPo_TGdl1GyXqANQB6JCLrnc935L2WRmiFW3FxTrn1QCRcI1KXg=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div><br /></div></div></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b>烏</b>暗ê研究室</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b>龍</b>銀藏tī運動科學ê名目　看無影跡</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b>Se̍h</b>來se̍h去　se̍h bē出系所ê門框</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b>桌</b>頂一堆表單　無一張講出in ê心聲</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">一枝針　tu̍h--入-去恬tsiuh-tsiuh</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">一kuānn研究　ba̍t-ba̍t是ê空喙</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">血leh流　經過烏青ê手khiau</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">喙leh咬　講bē出聲　只有吞落腹肚</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">風聲hiu-hiu叫ná親像有話講bē煞</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Mā m̄知是耳空重iah是am--起-來當做聽bē著</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">講一切lóng照起工</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">若án-ne　hit張bē赴市ê同意書</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Kám有真正問過「kám有願意」？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">有人想beh講　iáu未開喙就先驚惶</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">有人想beh走　koh m̄願放sak十幾冬ê拍拚</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">有人橫直留--leh　身軀留ē著　靈魂留bē tiâu</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">分數beh偌濟？就看你敢流偌濟血？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Lán ê教育　是beh教lán恬恬聽話？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Iah是beh教lán　m̄-thang踢出師道ê界線？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">跤球iáu leh踢</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tī學校kah tsiok濟所在leh tńg-se̍h</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">只不過</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">已經踢bē入去hit扇講是研究kah訓練ê球門</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b>創作理念</b></span></div><div>《青春無跤位》是一首為學生仔發聲ê詩。內底想beh描寫--ê，m̄-nā是tsit改『台師大女足抽血案』ê代誌，是想beh表達已經過時ê體育訓練體制kah傳統。Tsia-ê體育生hōo人當做試驗ê工具、kan-na ài聽話ê對象，失去為家己決定、選擇ê權利，實在hōo人tsiok m̄甘，所以用台語詩，對tsit件自頭到尾lóng是烏龍se̍h桌ê研究表達我ê不滿。</div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtA5u4OQb_Qhl5q2r99aRgS6aKK_ffPVom911metAlMvWjhnC7eRVuRvdAi-JYwGM7Kv5NwYeNdkjU8KywNl4TnmKLFayyu7KXUobnNYpeBcJi_oUfFxcS3gzUehqHADr_-1fWxkOwfySOO9cprCDdPa-Bk1I9ves5cKU6r6Bhaqq2P9NT5WHzXJsAkybW\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2139\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtA5u4OQb_Qhl5q2r99aRgS6aKK_ffPVom911metAlMvWjhnC7eRVuRvdAi-JYwGM7Kv5NwYeNdkjU8KywNl4TnmKLFayyu7KXUobnNYpeBcJi_oUfFxcS3gzUehqHADr_-1fWxkOwfySOO9cprCDdPa-Bk1I9ves5cKU6r6Bhaqq2P9NT5WHzXJsAkybW=w451-h640\" width=\"451\" /></a></div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: medium;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a